Subject: [PATCH] rustic: title_widgets_hidden and title_open helpers

A client mod that draws its own main menu over the title's panorama hides the
main title's widgets (title_widgets_hidden) and presses its buttons for the
player as a click does (title_open). Rustic ADR 0011, U13.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
